{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wendi-e-o007d","title":"苏则平张进黄华叛乱","accounts":[{"id":"wendi-e-o007d-account","label":"《文帝纪》正文","text":"苏则平张进黄华叛乱","evidence":["wendi-e-o007d-q"]},{"id":"wgc-a-0-e42","label":"正文","text":"毌丘兴讨张进及叛胡","evidence":["wgc-q0186","wgc-q0011"]},{"id":"liusima-a-9cf28867f4599c2422e8","label":"正文","text":"张进执郡守举兵拒邹岐，黄华、麹演各逐故太守举兵应之","evidence":["liusima-q-7a640fc9795029a728d2"]},{"id":"liusima-a-9c3997a30d92c9dbd6bf","label":"正文","text":"张既进兵为苏则声势，则得以有功","evidence":["liusima-q-aa0eab2115d01c9efa15"]},{"id":"rensu-a-2b6475c7ce31384a7228","label":"正文","text":"麹演复结旁郡为乱","evidence":["rensu-q-708104788f9f28e00771"]},{"id":"rensu-a-60352d874d90ac8347a6","label":"正文","text":"张掖张进执太守杜通","evidence":["rensu-q-672330646ed54726015e"]},{"id":"rensu-a-123d169beda6fd401f54","label":"正文","text":"酒泉黄华不受太守辛机，进、华皆自称太守以应麹演","evidence":["rensu-q-d8ad3784f12f64f762ae"]},{"id":"rensu-a-9ad7dda6263565f054c8","label":"正文","text":"武威太守毌丘兴告急于苏则","evidence":["rensu-q-e78f512255bb183010b0"]},{"id":"rensu-a-0159ae36fe1a06c5477a","label":"正文","text":"苏则见郡中大吏及郝昭等，与羌豪帅谋议因衅击贼、违诏专断","evidence":["rensu-q-8d497aa5e12452521112"]},{"id":"rensu-a-c9594d7d6c490d9a51a8","label":"正文","text":"郝昭等从苏则之谋，发兵救武威，降其三种胡","evidence":["rensu-q-8866e3b3b3c5ef093f51"]},{"id":"rensu-a-ad538556a877165fe6f4","label":"正文","text":"苏则与毌丘兴击张进于张掖","evidence":["rensu-q-f9e1009ed308649c45ca"]},{"id":"rensu-a-4ae6b2011951f99b134e","label":"正文","text":"麹演将步骑三千迎苏则，辞来助军实欲为变，苏则诱而斩之，徇军，其党皆散走","evidence":["rensu-q-87331ef88f5f111f3e7d"]},{"id":"rensu-a-c841c2b338963c3b0645","label":"正文","text":"苏则与诸军围张掖破之，斩张进及其支党，众皆降","evidence":["rensu-q-131d2e9d4727bb8913d2"]},{"id":"rensu-a-c21a8a9b64d2d55eada7","label":"正文","text":"麹演军败后黄华惧，出所执乞降","evidence":["rensu-q-9ebd4335c7d1500f1afd"]},{"id":"rensu-a-3e269f40c17b23b4d05d","label":"正文","text":"河西平定，苏则还金城","evidence":["rensu-q-89f8773457ad9ed676b9"]},{"id":"lizang-a-9eb219047918978c7a14","label":"正文","text":"酒泉黄华、张掖张进各据其郡，欲并势","evidence":["lizang-q-6990f13f51360a8892b1"]},{"id":"lizang-a-ef1a9928a8eb4a72acac","label":"正文","text":"张恭遣从弟张华攻酒泉沙头乾齐二县，又连兵继其后为首尾之援","evidence":["lizang-q-34bd8dc4ffe56d7434c3"]},{"id":"lizang-a-17b72ca370b4d3bfa5b7","label":"正文","text":"张恭别遣铁骑二百迎吏官属，径出张掖北河，逢迎太守尹奉","evidence":["lizang-q-49bc1aa25f35e32ade60"]},{"id":"lizang-a-0b1390562eff7d27ddc4","label":"正文","text":"张进须黄华之助，华欲救进而恐恭兵击后，遂诣金城太守苏则降","evidence":["lizang-q-bbbf7e14283ba5da8cab"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0008","role":"叛后降","evidence":["wendi-e-o007d-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0009","role":"叛被斩","evidence":["wendi-e-o007d-q"]},{"person":"wendi-p0010","role":"讨平","evidence":["wendi-e-o007d-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0328","role":"讨张进及叛胡","evidence":["wgc-q0186","wgc-q0011"]},{"person":"wudi-p0342","role":"逐故太守，举兵应张进","evidence":["liusima-q-7a640fc9795029a728d2"]},{"person":"liusima-p0062","role":"新任刺史，被举兵拒","evidence":["liusima-q-7a640fc9795029a728d2"]},{"person":"wgc-p0068","role":"进兵，为护羌校尉苏则声势","evidence":["liusima-q-aa0eab2115d01c9efa15"]},{"person":"wgc-p0066","role":"被执之张掖太守","evidence":["rensu-q-672330646ed54726015e"]},{"person":"rensu-p0049","role":"不得到职之酒泉太守","evidence":["rensu-q-d8ad3784f12f64f762ae"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0007","role":"预议将领；从议发兵者","evidence":["rensu-q-8d497aa5e12452521112","rensu-q-8866e3b3b3c5ef093f51"]},{"person":"liusima-p0026","role":"遣华攻二县连兵继后；遣骑逢迎尹奉","evidence":["lizang-q-34bd8dc4ffe56d7434c3","lizang-q-49bc1aa25f35e32ade60"]},{"person":"lizang-p0021","role":"攻沙头乾齐","evidence":["lizang-q-34bd8dc4ffe56d7434c3"]},{"person":"lizang-p0016","role":"被逢迎之新太守","evidence":["lizang-q-49bc1aa25f35e32ade60"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":220,"label":"延康元年五月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y220","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o002","basis":"延康元年五月"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o007d-q","wendi-q-o002","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o007d-q","source_order":[2,41,"O007d"],"order":486}],"persons":[{"id":"lizang-p0021","name":"张华（张恭从弟）","evidence":["lizang-q-34bd8dc4ffe56d7434c3"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-7a640fc9795029a728d2","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-9d369236f45a972c5dfe","layer":"original","quote":"张掖张进执郡守，举兵拒岐；黄华、麹演各逐故太守，举兵以应之","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-aa0eab2115d01c9efa15","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-9d369236f45a972c5dfe","layer":"original","quote":"既进兵，为护羌校尉苏则声势〖1〗，故则得以有功","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":160,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":52,"end":75,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-34bd8dc4ffe56d7434c3","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f2c7a004344479739639","layer":"original","quote":"恭即遣从弟华，攻酒泉沙头、乾齐二县〖14〗。恭又连兵，寻继华后，以为首尾之援","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":251,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-49bc1aa25f35e32ade60","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f2c7a004344479739639","layer":"original","quote":"别遣铁骑二百，迎吏官属；东缘酒泉北塞，径出张掖北河，逢迎太守尹奉","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":251,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":39,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-6990f13f51360a8892b1","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-70898cfcffa39d291237","layer":"original","quote":"时酒泉黄华、张掖张进，各据其郡，欲与恭（艾）并势","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":250,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":67,"end":91,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-bbbf7e14283ba5da8cab","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-f2c7a004344479739639","layer":"original","quote":"于是，张进须黄华之助〖16〗；华欲救进，西顾恭兵，恐急击其后，遂诣金城太守苏则降","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":251,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":76,"end":116,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-131d2e9d4727bb8913d2","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"则遂与诸军围张掖，破之；斩进及其支党，众皆降","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":224,"end":246,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-672330646ed54726015e","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f2a1f0d88b85b5a704a9","layer":"original","quote":"张掖张进执太守杜通","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":9,"end":18,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-708104788f9f28e00771","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f2a1f0d88b85b5a704a9","layer":"original","quote":"后演复结旁郡为乱","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-87331ef88f5f111f3e7d","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"演闻之，将步骑三千迎则；辞来助军〖8〗，而实欲为变。则诱与相见，因斩之；出以徇军〖9〗，其党皆散走","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":174,"end":223,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-8866e3b3b3c5ef093f51","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"于是昭等从之，乃发兵救武威；降其三种胡","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":146,"end":165,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-89f8773457ad9ed676b9","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"河西平，乃还金城","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":264,"end":272,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-8d497aa5e12452521112","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"则乃见郡中大吏及昭等〖3〗，与羌豪帅谋曰：“今贼虽盛，然皆新合；或有胁从，未必同心。因衅击之〖4〗，善恶必离；离而归我，我增而彼损矣。既获益众之实，且有倍气之势〖5〗；率以进讨，破之必矣。若待大军，旷日持久；善人无归，必合于恶；善恶既合，势难猝离。虽有诏命〖6〗，违而合权，专之可也","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-9ebd4335c7d1500f1afd","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"演军败，华惧，出所执乞降","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":247,"end":259,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-d8ad3784f12f64f762ae","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f2a1f0d88b85b5a704a9","layer":"original","quote":"酒泉黄华不受太守辛机〖1〗；进、华皆自称太守，以应之","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":19,"end":45,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-e78f512255bb183010b0","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-f2a1f0d88b85b5a704a9","layer":"original","quote":"武威太守毌丘兴，告急于则","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":30,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":62,"end":74,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-f9e1009ed308649c45ca","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-ff53aeeeca30c3bafe3a","layer":"original","quote":"与兴击进于张掖","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":31,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":166,"end":173,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-o007d-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-aff500edc4a38bf656c0","layer":"original","quote":"酒泉黄华、张掖张进等各执太守以叛〖9〗。金城太守苏则讨进，斩之〖10〗。华降。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":83,"end":122,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：黄初二年（公元 221）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8fff547b113ffa36bbc1","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o002","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-1c3ea4f0ea338bf2ec5a","layer":"original","quote":"太祖崩，嗣位为丞相，魏王。﹝三﹞尊王后曰王太后〖5〗。改建安二十五年为延康元年。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o019","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-8820e5c7f9006d364c44","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖1〗，郊祀天地、明堂〖2〗。甲戌〖3〗，校猎至原陵〖4〗。遣使者，以太牢祠汉世祖〖5〗。乙亥〖6〗，朝日于东郊〖7〗。﹝一﹞初令郡国口满十万者〖8〗，岁察孝廉一人；其有秀异〖9〗，无拘户口。辛巳〖10〗，分三公户邑，封子弟各一人为列侯。壬午〖11〗，复颍川郡一年田租〖12〗。﹝二﹞改许县为许昌县。以魏郡东部为阳平郡〖13〗，西部为广平郡〖14〗。﹝三﹞","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":208,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":183,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0011","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-9d2fd98fa3c9420e521b","layer":"original","quote":"毌丘俭字仲恭〖1〗，河东闻喜人也。父兴，黄初中为武威太守；伐叛柔服〖2〗，开通河右，名次金城太守苏则〖3〗。讨贼张进及讨叛胡有功，封高阳乡侯。﹝一﹞入为将作大匠。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":81,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0186","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-9d2fd98fa3c9420e521b","layer":"original","quote":"讨贼张进及讨叛胡有功","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":60,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":54,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
